,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Burnet County runs from 1951 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 that same pair ran 257% of normal on the middle, while November to December fell to 55%. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 198% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 12427 down to 32%.</p>"}
